# Test Runner Specification: Incremental E2E Test Execution & Auto-Fix

## Purpose
A system to run Playwright E2E tests in configurable subsets, track status between runs, and automatically fix bugs after all tests complete.

## Requirements
1. Run tests in groups (not all 1,613 at once)
2. Update status after each group completes
3. After all groups run, group failures and fix bugs automatically
4. Provide clear pass/fail/unknown status at all times

## Test Groups (15 categories, 1,613 tests)

| Group | Files | Test Count | Description |
|-------|-------|------------|-------------|
| undo-redo | undo-redo*.spec.ts | ~50 | All undo/redo tests |
| canvas | canvas-*.spec.ts | ~30 | Canvas controls, rendering |
| export | export-*.spec.ts | ~20 | PNG, PDF, sharing |
| drawing | drawing-*.spec.ts | ~40 | Pencil, eraser, fill, shapes |
| colors | color-*.spec.ts | ~30 | Palette, history, swap |
| grid | grid-*.spec.ts | ~40 | Labels, snapping, rulers |
| keyboard | keyboard-*.spec.ts | ~20 | Shortcuts, panels |
| progress | progress-*.spec.ts | ~10 | Progress tracker |
| settings | settings-*.spec.ts | ~20 | Config, persistence |
| onboarding | onboarding-*.spec.ts | ~10 | Tour, intro |
| notes | notes-*.spec.ts | ~10 | Annotations |
| inventory | inventory-*.spec.ts | ~20 | Stock management |
| pattern | pattern-*.spec.ts | ~20 | Repeat, mirror |
| 3d | 3d-*.spec.ts | ~10 | 3D visualizer |
| misc | *_debug*.spec.ts, other | ~50 | Debug, cleanup, edge cases |

## Execution Flow

```
1. Start test run (create status file)
2. Run Group 1 (undo-redo) → update status
3. Run Group 2 (canvas) → update status
4. ... continue for all groups ...
5. All groups complete? → Run fix-bugs.sh
6. Fix bugs → re-run affected tests
7. Repeat until all pass or max iterations reached
```

## Status File Format (`test-status.json`)

```json
{
  "runId": "run-2026-05-03-160000",
  "startTime": "2026-05-03T16:00:00Z",
  "currentGroup": "undo-redo",
  "completedGroups": [],
  "allGroups": ["undo-redo", "canvas", "export", "drawing", "colors", "grid", "keyboard", "progress", "settings", "onboarding", "notes", "inventory", "pattern", "3d", "misc"],
  "results": {
    "undo-redo": {
      "status": "complete",
      "total": 50,
      "passed": 45,
      "failed": 5,
      "failures": [
        {
          "testName": "undo reverts last grid edit",
          "file": "tests/e2e/undo-redo.spec.ts",
          "error": "expected to be visible",
          "stack": "..."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "fixBugsRun": false,
  "maxFixIterations": 3,
  "currentFixIteration": 0
}
```

## Commands

```bash
# Run all tests (with groups)
bash test-runner.sh run-all

# Run a single group
bash test-runner.sh run-group undo-redo

# Check status
bash test-runner.sh status

# Fix bugs after all tests run
bash test-runner.sh fix

# View summary
bash test-runner.sh summary
```

## Fix Strategy

After all tests complete, `fix-bugs.sh` runs:

1. **Group failures** by file/category
2. **Identify common patterns** (e.g., 5 failures all saying "element not found")
3. **Create fix plan** (priority order: app bugs > test bugs > infrastructure)
4. **Apply fixes** one at a time
5. **Re-run only affected tests** to verify
6. **Repeat** until all pass or max iterations (3) reached

## Discord Integration

After each group run, send a summary:
```
🦞 Test Group: [name]
✅ Passed: X | ❌ Failed: Y
Top failures: [list]
Next group: [name]
```

After all tests complete:
```
🦞 All Tests Complete
✅ Total Passed: X | ❌ Failed: Y | ⏭️ Skipped: Z
Pass rate: Z%
Fixes applied: [list]
Remaining failures: [list]
```

## Dependencies

- Playwright 1.59.1 ✅
- Chromium browser ✅
- Vite preview server on :5556 ✅
- Node.js v22.22.1 ✅

## Setup Required

1. Create `test-groups.json` with group definitions
2. Create `test-runner.sh` script
3. Create `fix-bugs.sh` script
4. Update cron job to use new runner
